                  Parameters for VMODEL
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
vmodel.var   \file for variogram output
1 20   \number of directions and lags
0 0 0.5   \azm, dip, lag distance
1 0.05   \nst, nugget effect
3 0.95 0 0 0   \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
8 8 8   \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
